# KoanBrowserViewController::TearDown()'s "Koan: window torn down" line (#193).
--vmodule=koan_browser_view_controller=1
# The window_closer extension: closeWindowOf() in lib/mac.mjs ({root} is the
# repo; scripts/mac/suite.sh expands it).
--load-extension={root}/scripts/e2e/extensions/window_closer
